96% of holdout splits; minutes gap positive in 84%\n- observed_sample_and_power: n~198 movers, 500 splits, half~99\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPM-039\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-PAP-032\n- observed_verdict: supported"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-PAP-032", "score": 0.088, "document": "# FAM:SF-PAP-032 | Study family SF-PAP-032: Travel x fit screen vs real player outcomes (minutes, usage, net rating)\n- observed_research_question: Travel x fit screen vs real player outcomes (minutes, usage, net rating)\n- auto_outcome_status: inconclusive\n- observed_hypothesis: The travel x fit quadrant (additive vs redundant/missed-need/irrelevant) predicts post-move minutes, usage, and destination on-court net rating.\n- observed_result: n=198; embedded mpg>=15: additive 0.80, redundant 0.85, missed-need 0.50, irrelevant 0.68; mean dest net: additive -0.63, redundant -0.35, missed-need -2.50, irrelevant -3.58; corr(delta, dest_net)=+0.077; corr(travel_sc [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:LEAKAGE_LOOKAHEAD\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:OUTCOME_DERIVED_LABEL\n- observed_failure_evidence: net-rating gap additive vs irrelevant is large but corr(delta, dest_net)=+0.077; fit_score correlations are negative; in-sample thresholds\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=198 movers"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-088", "score": 0.075, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-088 | Study family SF-APPS-088: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- observed_research_question: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Connector absence displaces team offensive identity (D_A) more than usage-matched non-organizer absence.\n- observed_result: Unmatched conn vs role D_A 0.2020 vs 0.1021, t=5.97 p=2.87e-08. Usage-matched vs role: paired dD_A +0.1151, P(conn>ctrl)=81.2%, t=6.35 p=7.35e-09 n=96. Vs terminal: +0.0777 t=2.